@startuml
' OWNER-MVP-2026-11-04 review: MVP core / cross-cutting. Core presentation/application/files or shared authority/recovery invariant remains applicable.
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam ArrowColor #526B7B
skinparam ArrowFontSize 11
skinparam stateBackgroundColor #EDF4FB
skinparam stateBorderColor #526B7B
skinparam stateStartColor #163E52
skinparam stateEndColor #163E52
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFF3DF
skinparam noteBorderColor #B99557
skinparam nodesep 38
skinparam ranksep 48
hide empty description
top to bottom direction

title SM-M10 — Local/provider mapping and freshness
state "Local-only / unmapped\nactivity" as Local
state "Mapped fields confirmed\ncurrent" as Fresh
state "Mapped copy stale /\ndisconnected" as Stale
state "Mapped change requires\nresolution" as Conflict
state "Provider event removed /\nunavailable" as Removed
[*] --> Local : scoped initial context
Local --> Fresh : SM-T059 explicit mapping confirmed\n[selected mapping confirmed]
Fresh --> Stale : SM-T060 provider / connection\nchanges\n[freshness no longer proven]
Fresh --> Conflict : SM-T061 concurrent edits found\n[conflicting versions]
Stale --> Conflict : SM-T062 conflict established\n[conflict evidence]
Stale --> Fresh : SM-T063 mapped state reconciled\n[fresh result confirmed]
Conflict --> Fresh : SM-T064 resolution confirmed\n[explicit confirmed resolution]
Fresh --> Removed : SM-T065 provider deletion confirmed\n[provider deletion evidence]
Fresh --> Local : SM-T066 unlink local mapping\n[local unlink only]
Removed --> Local : SM-T067 clear removed mapping\n[explicit local action]
legend bottom
A: accepted core behavior; P: existing proposal; R: proposed refinement.
State labels are analysis abstractions, not implemented enums.
Transition tables define full actor, guard, effect and status.
Unconfirmed operation effects require SM-M18 reconciliation.
endlegend
@enduml
